; Shared B publication identity state. Runtime Fence and authenticated cold
; source consumers retain owned evidence here; no directory row is authority
; after rebase. This book has no I/O issue or caller-ready operation.
(in-package "ACL2")
(include-book "checkpoint")
(fn2-book-layer :b)

